Sextans Suite
Copyright 2024-2026 Mark D. Wilkinson and contributors

This repository distributes installer scripts and Docker Compose templates
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Those files orchestrate a stack of
separable third-party programs. This NOTICE does not change the Apache-2.0
license of the installer. Third-party components remain under their own
licenses. The installer is an aggregation of independent works that
communicate over ordinary network protocols (HTTP, SPARQL). It is not a
combined derivative of those works.

Nothing in this repository grants you a license to third-party software
beyond what the authors of that software already grant.

