---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party software pulled or rebuilt at install time
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Operators who run the installer will download container images. Some images
are official upstream images; some are rebuilds or OS-level security refreshes
published under the fairdatasystems Docker Hub namespace. A security refresh
of an image (package updates in the container OS) does not relicense the
application inside the image.

1. OpenLink Virtuoso Open Source Edition
   Typical image: openlink/virtuoso-opensource-7
   and/or a security-refreshed copy such as fairdatasystems/virtuoso
   License: GNU General Public License, Version 2 only
     https://github.com/openlink/virtuoso-opensource
   Copyright: OpenLink Software
   Corresponding source for unmodified VOS is the official OpenLink tree
   for the tagged release (currently 7.2.17). If this project distributes a
   container that contains modifications to Virtuoso itself, those
   modifications will be published under GPL-2.0-only at:
     https://github.com/wilkinsonlab/Sextans-Suite
   OS package updates inside the container are not modifications of Virtuoso.

2. FAIR Data Point (server)
   Upstream: FAIRDataTeam/FAIRDataPoint
   Typical image: fairdata/fairdatapoint or a rebuild such as
   fairdatasystems/fdpserv2
   License: MIT
   Copyright: FAIR Data Team and contributors
   https://github.com/FAIRDataTeam/FAIRDataPoint

3. FAIR Data Point Client
   Upstream: FAIRDataTeam/FAIRDataPoint-client
   Typical image: fairdata/fairdatapoint-client
   and/or a security-refreshed copy such as fairdatasystems/fdpclient
   License: MIT
   Copyright: 2019 Dutch Techcentre for Life Sciences and contributors
   https://github.com/FAIRDataTeam/FAIRDataPoint-client

4. MongoDB Community Server
   Typical image: mongo:7
   and/or a security-refreshed copy such as fairdatasystems/mdb
   License: Server Side Public License, v1 (SSPL)
   Copyright: MongoDB, Inc.
   https://www.mongodb.com/licensing/server-side-public-license
   Sextans uses MongoDB only as a local implementation detail of a
   self-hosted FAIR Data Point. This project does not offer MongoDB as a
   managed service to third parties.

5. CARE-SM toolkit / CARE Semantic Model tooling
   Upstream: CARE-SM project and related Wilkinson Lab builds
   Typical images: pabloalarconm/care-sm-toolkit or fairdatasystems/care2
   License: MIT
   https://github.com/CARE-SM

6. YARRRML / RML transformation image
   Built from this repository's yarrrml-rml/ tree and/or RML.io components
   RML.io components are typically MIT; see that directory for bundled notices.

